# AI Steering — lazy load (token saver)

Do **NOT** read all `.ai-steering/*.md` files upfront. Use this index and load only what the task needs:

| File | Buka saat |
|------|-----------|
| `00-system-prompt.md` | Konvensi kode, persona, clean code |
| `01-project-overview.md` | Konteks bisnis, role pengguna |
| `02-architecture-and-stack.md` | Stack, struktur folder, env |
| `03-database-schema-erd.md` / `03-state-management.md` | Schema DB atau state management |
| `04-api-contracts-and-standards.md` / `04-api-integration.md` | Kontrak API, format request |
| `05-business-rules-sops.md` | Logika bisnis (saldo, poin, status) |
| `06-system-constraints.md` | Batasan sistem (payment, GPS, dll.) |
| `07-modules-and-features.md` | Modul spesifik yang sedang dikerjakan |
| `08-task-list.md` | Roadmap / urutan pengerjaan |

**Prefer graphify first:** `graphify query "<topik>"` often covers steering + code in one subgraph — cheaper than reading 9 markdown files.

Only read a steering file directly when graphify/wiki does not answer the specific detail you need.
